OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after motorbike crash in
OL,4,ACarrickfergus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a motorbike crash
OL,7,Fin County Antrim on Wednesday.
OL,9,FHe's been named as 52-year-old Philip
OL,10,FMcMeekan from Comber, County Down.
OL,12,FPolice received a report at about 19:25
OL,13,FBST of a crash on the Shore Road in
OL,14,FCarrickfergus involving a Triumph
OL,15,FRocket motorcycle.
OL,17,FOfficers attended, alongside other
OL,18,Femergency services, but McMeekan was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
